This project includes code adapted from MatGL v2.0.0:

- All other code in this project was written by the project authors, except as
  otherwise noted.
- `_activations.py`, `_bond.py`, `_training_dgl.py`, `layers.py`, and
  `esf_megnet.py` are derived from MatGL's layers, training utilities, and
  MEGNet model.
- `dataset.py` is derived from MatGL's DGL graph data utilities.
- The adapted code was modified to support charge, ICOHP, and ICOBI features,
  including additional feature transformations and graph updates.

MatGL source files:

- https://github.com/materialyzeai/matgl/blob/v2.0.0/src/matgl/layers/_activations.py
- https://github.com/materialyzeai/matgl/blob/v2.0.0/src/matgl/layers/_bond.py
- https://github.com/materialyzeai/matgl/blob/v2.0.0/src/matgl/utils/_training_dgl.py
- https://github.com/materialyzeai/matgl/blob/v2.0.0/src/matgl/layers/_core_dgl.py
- https://github.com/materialyzeai/matgl/blob/v2.0.0/src/matgl/layers/_graph_convolution_dgl.py
- https://github.com/materialyzeai/matgl/blob/v2.0.0/src/matgl/models/_megnet.py
- https://github.com/materialyzeai/matgl/blob/v2.0.0/src/matgl/graph/_data_dgl.py


